{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locked Together is a horror experience inspired by escape rooms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into levels, each offering a unique mini-adventure with different environments, items, puzzles, and entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/bd700b5fa1cc24c388d7eae7ff492e17.poster.avif?t=1759675802\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/bd700b5fa1cc24c388d7eae7ff492e17.webm?t=1759675802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/bd700b5fa1cc24c388d7eae7ff492e17.mp4?t=1759675802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the challenge alone or with friends in co-op. Solve the puzzles and find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/3c33ed91c1c80f735f527cb5bc311fc4.poster.avif?t=1759675802\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/3c33ed91c1c80f735f527cb5bc311fc4.webm?t=1759675802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/3c33ed91c1c80f735f527cb5bc311fc4.mp4?t=1759675802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine and interact with items as you try to unravel the mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.poster.avif?t=1759675802\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.webm?t=1759675802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.mp4?t=1759675802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to be part of the development process or or stay updated with the latest news, join the <strong>Discord</strong>. Every type of feedback is appreciated!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507220?t=1759675802","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507220?t=1759675802","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/d84c9617f32ee695e0f6d9ff182849656a11d80e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759675802","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/d84c9617f32ee695e0f6d9ff182849656a11d80e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759675802","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages: Frequent Violence or Gore"},"demos":[{"appid":3707680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locked Together is a horror experience inspired by escape rooms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into levels, each offering a unique mini-adventure with different environments, items, puzzles, and entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla